cipiter</hi>, <hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">l'autour</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the gooshawk</hi></hi>). <hi rendition="#aq">F. ce-<lb/>
ra nigra, margine pedibusque flavis, corpore fus-<lb/>
