<p rendition="#indent-2">9. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Nisus</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Sperber, Vogelfalke</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">l'éper-<lb/>
