II. B. S. 325 u. f.</p></note>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">9. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Brama</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">der Bley, Brachsen</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">la brème</hi></hi>).<lb/>
