riis.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Klein</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 7. <hi rendition="#aq">A. et</hi> 39. <hi rendition="#aq">fig.</hi> 2.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">3. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Orbiculus.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">E. planus suborbiculatus; ambulacris</hi><lb/>
5 <hi rendition="#aq">ovalibus, ano subremoto.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Klein</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 21 <hi rendition="#aq">sq.</hi></p>
