100. vom <hi rendition="#g">Kraken</hi> sagt: <q>&#x201E;<hi rendition="#aq">Tracta haec</hi> <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#aq">fabula</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">videtur ex in-<lb/>
sula</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#aq">aliquando conspicua, saepius tamen inconspicua</hi>.&#x201C;</q></p></note>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-1">67. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Encrinus</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Stirps elongata, corpore terminali ra-<lb/>
diato.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Asteria.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#g">die See-Palme</hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">isis</hi> <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">asteria</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Linn</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">E.<lb/>
