tentaculis rotatoriis ciliatis, cauda bicuspidata</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Rotatoria</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">das Räderthier</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the wheel-<lb/>
